Reason: the First Person mod's rifle and bazooka (FLUDD held in view, api->held_fludd): their own models are drawn in FLUDD's place while one is chosen (ext/modapi/game/modapi_weapon_models.cpp). As FLUDD is entered for drawing, its packet is entered instead and FLUDD (and its nozzle) left out. Without the mod holding one, nothing changes.

--- a/src/Player/WaterGun.cpp
